ISO-10303-21;
/* P027: BSpline-surface face with a hole loop whose PCURVE domain is degenerate (zero length: start == end at parameter 0.0); hole-loop pcurve maps outside the surface's natural domain; STEP writer dereferences null on face-emission pass and crashes; reader must reject malformed pcurves with clear message; B_SPLINE_SURFACE + PCURVE + SURFACE_CURVE are the defect entities; GEOMETRIC_CURVE_SET IS model entity — OCC yields empty */
